  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/FC65E4">Example <span data-tag="FC65E4">5.5.8.24</span>.</a> The $\infty $-category $\SSet $ of spaces is projectively generated. The compact projective objects of $\SSet $ are precisely those spaces which are homotopy equivalent to finite sets (endowed with the discrete topology). </p>
